            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked: \u201cWhat is a statement respecting financial condition? In addition to a balance sheet and a profit and loss statement, what else would qualify?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 7,
              "start": 7
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked: \u201cWhat do you think the difference is between \u2018relating to\u2019 and \u2018about\u2019?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg later asked for clarification on the argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0001-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 25,
              "start": 25
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked: \u201cWhich says more about your financial condition, Mr. Garre?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0001-0008"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 43,
              "start": 43
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked about the argument that Congress was seeking to protect debtors from credit\u2011card companies omitting particular items."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 45,
              "start": 45
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked: \u201cWould you respond to Mr. Garre\u2019s argument that the statement here concerns ability to pay and not financial condition?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b2eb95a27a0d-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 47,
              "start": 47
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked: \u201cWhat about the argument that you would be putting a burden on small businesses that deal informally?\u201d"
      }
    ],
