              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case concerns the interpretation of Section 523(a)(2)(A) of the Bankruptcy Code, which bars the discharge of debts obtained by fraudulent statements, except when the statement concerns the debtor\u2019s financial condition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner, Respondent, and United States (Amicus)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b2eb95a27a0d39eb030aebbec648ca9dd949286a76fbbdcfc681851a89357e43",
            "evidence_ids": [
